35,2,1,talk,Mizuki,,The data shows we drifted apart last year. We need a place that forces us together.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Shizue,,I found that separate rooms cost very different amounts last time. It felt unfair.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Minato,,I found the baths are shared and the food times are very early. That worries me.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Jonathan,,I found the ferry takes two days each way. That is too much waiting for me.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Midori,,"I found the all-in rate is the same for everyone, but separate rooms cost wildly different amounts.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Mizuki,,"@Jonathan, two days is a lot, but the drift is worse.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Shizue,,"@Midori, yes, the separate costs were a source of quiet stress for me.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Minato,,I think the shared bath and the early dinner might make me feel very small.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Jonathan,,"I think the train is better, but the city feels too loud for me.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Midori,,I think the all-in rate is the only way to keep the bill fair and predictable.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Mizuki,,I am leaning toward the valley inn. It forces us to be in the same room.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Shizue,,I agree. The all-in rate means no one is left paying for the others’ choices.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Minato,,"I am afraid of the shared bath, but I do not want to be alone in a city room.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Jonathan,,"I am afraid of the noise, but I am more afraid of the two days on the ferry.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Midori,,I am leaning toward the valley inn. The all-in rate means I know the total before we go.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Mizuki,,The valley inn seems to solve the drift and the fairness problem at once.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Shizue,,"I am comfortable with that. The money falls out of the arrangement, not the person.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,Minato,,I will try to sleep through the early dinner. I hope the bath is warm.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,Jonathan,,I will try to read in the quiet corners. I hope the noise is not too much.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Midori,,"I am comfortable with that. The total is known, and the bill is shared evenly.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
